sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client / Postman
    participant ALB as Public ALB (:80)
    participant Booking as booking-service (ECS Private)
    participant SSM as AWS SSM Parameter Store
    participant DNS as Route 53 / Cloud Map
    participant Room as room-service (ECS Private)
    participant RoomDB as RDS room_db
    participant BookingDB as RDS booking_db
    participant Audit as DynamoDB audit log
    participant SNS as SNS topic
    participant SQS as SQS main queue
    participant Notif as notification-service
    participant DLQ as SQS dead-letter queue
    participant CW as CloudWatch (Logs, Alarms)

    Note over SSM, Booking: Khi Task khoi dong: ECS doc DB credentials tu SSM Parameter Store qua LabRole
    Client->>ALB: POST /api/bookings (Header: X-Correlation-Id)
    ALB->>Booking: Route toi booking-service
    Note over Booking: Nap X-Correlation-Id vao SLF4J MDC Log context
    Booking->>DNS: Resolve room-service.hotel.local
    DNS-->>Booking: Private Task IP
    Booking->>Room: PUT /api/rooms/{id}/status (RESERVED) [X-Correlation-Id]
    Room->>RoomDB: JDBC: cap nhat trang thai phong
    RoomDB-->>Room: Commit
    Room-->>Booking: 200 OK / 409 CONFLICT

    alt Xu ly nghiep vu tiep theo that bai (Loi JDBC / SDK)
        Booking->>Room: COMPENSATING ACTION: PUT /api/rooms/{id}/status (AVAILABLE)
        Room->>RoomDB: Rollback trang thai phong
        Booking->>CW: Log ERROR kem correlationId
        Booking-->>Client: 500 / 400 Problem Details (kem correlationId)
    else Xu ly thanh cong (Happy Path)
        Booking->>BookingDB: JDBC: luu don dat phong
        Booking->>Audit: PutItem (bookingId, timestamp, correlationId)
        Booking->>SNS: Publish Event (kem correlationId trong Message Attribute)
        SNS->>SQS: Fanout subscription (raw message)
        Booking->>CW: Stream Log INFO kem correlationId
        Booking-->>Client: 201 Created (Booking JSON)
    end

    Notif->>SQS: Long poll / ReceiveMessage
    SQS-->>Notif: Nhan message kem correlationId
    Note over Notif: Trich xuat correlationId vao MDC
    alt Gui thong bao thanh cong
        Notif->>CW: Log INFO mo phong gui email (kem correlationId)
        Notif->>SQS: DeleteMessage (ACK)
    else Xu ly loi vuot qua maxReceiveCount = 3
        SQS-->>DLQ: Chuyen poison message vao DLQ
        DLQ-->>CW: Metric ApproximateNumberOfMessagesVisible >= 1
        CW->>CW: Trigger Alarm: SQS-DLQ-Has-Poison-Messages -> Ban SNS Alert
    end
